{"id":"A1-L089","title":"Key verb: run","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U06","focus":"Verbo-chave: run","targets":{"grammar":"Verbo-chave: run","pron":"do you (fala rápida)","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":["make coffee"],"words":["kilometer","cart","receipt","discount","bargain","queue","cashier","shelf life"],"field":"Lazer","genre":"Anúncio, folheto, aviso","skill":"Fala","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 89 · Key verb: run","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Verbo-chave: run.","**Expressões:** make coffee.","**Pronúncia:** do you (fala rápida).","**8 palavras novas** (lazer).","**Texto do dia:** anúncio, folheto, aviso."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo usar run em vários sentidos e fazer coffee."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["kilometer","quilômetro"],["cart","carrinho"],["receipt","recibo"],["discount","desconto"],["bargain","pechincha"],["queue","fila"],["cashier","caixa (pessoa)"],["shelf life","validade"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An advertisement","blocks":[{"type":"ad","title":"Run & Coffee Club","lines":["Every Saturday we **run** five kilometers in the park. After the run, we **make coffee** and talk.","Our group **runs** a small café. Prices **run** from $2 to $5.","**Run** to join us! The first month is free."],"gloss":[["kilometer","quilômetro"],["club","clube"],["prices","preços"],["free","grátis"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The club runs on Saturdays.","ans":"T","why":"“Every Saturday.”"},{"q":"After running, they make tea.","ans":"F","why":"coffee."},{"q":"The first month is free.","ans":"T","why":"“free.”"}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“kilometer” means…","opts":["quilômetro","milha","metro"],"ans":0,"why":"kilometer."},{"q":"“prices run from $2 to $5” means…","opts":["vão de 2 a 5","correm rápido","sobem sempre"],"ans":0,"why":"run = variar."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: run","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Sentido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["correr","**I run in the park.**"],["administrar","**She runs a café.**"],["variar","**Prices run from $2 to $5.**"],["funcionar","**The bus runs every ten minutes.**"]],"cap":"Key verb: run"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Irregular: **run – ran – run**; -ing: **running**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"We ___ five kilometers. (run)","a":"run","why":"run."},{"s":"She ___ a café. (run)","a":"runs","why":"administrar."},{"s":"Prices ___ from $2 to $5. (run)","a":"run","why":"variar."},{"s":"After the run, we ___ coffee. (make)","a":"make","why":"make coffee.","say":"make coffee"}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["kilometer","quilômetro"],["cart","carrinho"],["receipt","recibo"],["discount","desconto"],["bargain","pechincha"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["you","run","Do"],"ans":"Do you run","pt":"Você corre?"},{"words":["club","Who","runs","the"],"ans":"Who runs the club","pt":"Quem administra o clube?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"kilometer","pos":"word","pt":"quilômetro","ex":"Five kilometers.","expt":"Cinco quilômetros."},{"w":"cart","pos":"word","pt":"carrinho","ex":"Push the cart.","expt":"Empurre o carrinho."},{"w":"receipt","pos":"word","pt":"recibo","ex":"Keep the receipt.","expt":"Guarde o recibo."},{"w":"discount","pos":"word","pt":"desconto","ex":"A ten percent discount.","expt":"Um desconto de dez por cento."},{"w":"bargain","pos":"word","pt":"pechincha","ex":"This is a bargain.","expt":"Isto é uma pechincha."},{"w":"queue","pos":"word","pt":"fila","ex":"A long queue.","expt":"Uma fila longa."},{"w":"cashier","pos":"word","pt":"caixa (pessoa)","ex":"The cashier smiles.","expt":"O caixa sorri."},{"w":"shelf life","pos":"word","pt":"validade","ex":"Check the shelf life.","expt":"Confira a validade."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**make coffee** — fazer café","**Do you run?** — Você corre?","**Every Saturday.** — Todo sábado.","**Who runs the club?** — Quem administra o clube?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"tip","t":"Verbos desta aula","body":"Esta aula revisa verbos já vistos dentro das frases do diálogo e dos exercícios. Observe: **be, have, do**."}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Club","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Club","lines":[["Ana","Do you run?","Você corre?"],["Leo","Every Saturday.","Todo sábado."],["Ana","Who runs the club?","Quem administra o clube?"],["Leo","Mia does.","A Mia."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: do you (fala rápida)","items":[{"label":"do you (fala rápida)","note":"Na fala rápida, do you soa /dʒu/ ou /dəjə/.","words":["Do you like it?","What do you do?","Where do you live?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say how you run.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I run five kilometers on Saturday."},{"q":"Invite someone.","pt":"Convide.","model":"Run with us!"},{"q":"Say you make coffee.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I make coffee after the run."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with run.","model":"I run in the park. She runs a café. Prices run from $2 to $5. The bus runs every ten minutes. We make coffee after the run.","che